# PortableApps: keep the folder structure (.keep files), ignore the programs inside.
# README.txt and Portable-Launcher.ps1 sit directly in PortableApps\ so they are still tracked.
PortableApps/*/*
!PortableApps/*/.keep

# Per-computer data: logs and reports contain computer/user names, so keep them out of the repo.
Logs/*
!Logs/.keep
Reports/*
!Reports/.keep

# Local backups made by the merge scripts
Config/backup/
